  "liner": {
   "body_md": "This recording captures a performance by the Mountain Goats on Sunday, 25 February 1996, at the Tower venue in Bremen, Germany [1]. The setlist consists of thirteen songs, including the first archived versions of The Monkey Song, Orange Ball of Hate, The Hot Garden Stomp, Snow Crush Killing Song, Banter (Through the Mists of Time), Tollund Man, Stars Around Her, Tulsa Imperative, Stars Fell On Alabama, and Banter (Like a Bad Dog) [1]. The track Seeing Daylight is noted as being performed with pph [1]. The recording, which lasts 36 minutes, was transferred by notasfarwest [1]. This is the fourth show in the archive's collection for this performer [2]. The previous archived show took place on 22 April 1995 at Fast Forward II in Doornroosje, Nijmegen, Netherlands [2]. This is the only available recording of the event [1].",
